  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNSDG Human Rights Mainstreaming Mechanism</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose is to institutionalise the mainstreaming of human rights, including gender equality and women&apos;s empowerment - into UN operatioanl activities for development by strenghtening system wide coherence, collaboration and support for UNRCs and the UNCTs on human rights mainstreaming.</narrative>
  </description>
